...@../../../dev/d2/themes/flow
direction: down
caller: Weaver / MRR\nTyped build and test requests {class: card}
facade: gerbil-scheme\nGerbilRuntime package operations {class: card}
bridge: Gerbil C ABI\nChecked values / host-state lifetime {class: card}
owner: Existing VM owner\nMatching image / owner thread {class: card}
scheme: Official Scheme procedures\nbuild.ss main / GxTest main {class: card}
image: Admitted tooling image\nCompiler / expander / package closure {class: card}
tokio: Tokio host supervision\nOutput / deadlines / natural exit {class: card}
complete: Build and test receipts\nRequired artifacts / nonempty tests {class: card}
refused: Refused or unresolved operation\nRetain owner / await cleanup {class: card}
backend: Gambit compiler backend\nOfficial invocation / child reaping {class: card}
caller -> facade: typed operation
facade -> bridge: direct foreign call
bridge -> owner: owner-checked entry
image -> owner: matching linked image
owner -> scheme: existing Scheme semantics
tokio -> owner: observe owner lifetime
scheme -> complete: artifact and test evidence
scheme -> refused: exception or unresolved outcome
complete -> caller: checked result
refused -> tokio: cleanup observation

scheme -> backend: official compiler invocation
backend -> scheme: complete diagnostics

